### Stripe Checkout Creation (requires authentication)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/stripe/create-checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SUPABASE_JWT_TOKEN

{}

### Stripe Webhook Test (use ngrok for local testing)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/stripe/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: YOUR_STRIPE_SIGNATURE

{
  "id": "evt_test_webhook",
  "object": "event",
  "api_version": "2024-06-20",
  "created": 1677649948,
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "cs_test_session",
      "object": "checkout.session",
      "metadata": {
        "user_id": "test-user-id"
      }
    }
